  "description": "YIGJII crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 Eu4 O12,x(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu1B (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu1A (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu1C (Eu) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.660-3.660 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.25-105.78°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132Eu4O12·x(C7H8).",
